    "chunk_text": "ne. Hi gewita\u00f0 ealle aweg mid \u00fey utgange & he bi\u00f0 sona hal. To \u00feon ilcan genim cymenes dust, meng to gate geallan & fearres, gnid \u00feone nafolan mid ealle. Hi gewita\u00fe ni\u00feer of \u00fe\u00e6m men. Wi\u00fe li\u00f0 w\u00e6rce sing VIIII si\u00feum \u00feis gealdor \u00fe\u00e6r on & \u00fein spatl spiw on, Malignus obligauit, Him bi\u00fe sona sel. To \u00feon ilcan genim culfran tord & gate tord, drige swi\u00f0e & gnid to duste, meng wi\u00fe hunig & wi\u00fe Wi\u00fe weartum genim hundes micgean & muse blod, meng to somne, smire mid \u00fea weartan. Hi gewita\u00fe sona aweg. Wi\u00fe miclan lice genim nio\u00feowearde elenan & \u00feung & ompran \u00fea \u00fee swimman wile, ealra emfela, Wyrc b\u00e6\u00f0 wi\u00fe \u00feam miclan lice, elene, \u00e6lf\u00feone, marubie, curmealle, ellentanas & actanas, wyl Wyrc drenc wi\u00f0 \u00feam miclan lice, hindhiolo\u00fean, curmeallan, bogen, nefte, agrimonia, betonica, Wyrc briw wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan, genim nio\u00feowearde elenan & eofor \u00ferotan, redic & \u00fea readan netlan Wi\u00fe singalum \u00feurste untrumra manna nim wermod & hind hiolo\u00fean & gy\u00ferifan, wylle on eala\u00fe, Hit h\u00e6l\u00fe \u00feone \u00feurst wundorlice. Wi\u00fe innan fortoge, sm\u00e6l \u00feearma ece, genim betonican & wermod, merce, r\u00e6dic, finul, gecnua ealle Wi\u00fe bryne, gif mon sie mid fyre ane forb\u00e6rned nim wudurofan & lilian & hle",
